@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Note API
	Testing Koroneiki Note API functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Auto Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Engr Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Automotive      |
	| Koroneiki Engineering     |

Scenario: Create and view note
	Koroneiki notes created via API should be viewable via API.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create a note for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the following values
	| Content  | Account Note Content |
	| Format   | HTML                 |
	| Priority | 1                    |
	| Status   | Approved             |
	| Type     | General              |
	Then I should be able to view a note on koroneiki for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the content "Account Note Content" and the following values
	| Content  | Account Note Content |
	| Format   | HTML                 |
	| Priority | 1                    |
	| Status   | Approved             |
	| Type     | General              |

Scenario: Create and view multiple notes
	Multiple koroneiki notes created via API should be viewable via API.

